{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/e9349c54abb101e052157b8efb21d32e.avif?t=1735077065\" width=630 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DrumBeatsVR is a VR drumming music game that lets you experience the thrill of playing drums on a virtual stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place behind the kits of the most iconic players and play their parts, with your driving rhythm becoming the backbone of every song you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/7a9e558488fbb9988ad527f52eba23b6.avif?t=1735077065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras_big/7a9e558488fbb9988ad527f52eba23b6.avif?t=1735077065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a setlist of twenty-one songs and more on the way, you can play along to your favorite tunes and feel like you're part of the band. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in epic scenes that will transport you to otherworldly locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the comfort of your own home, you can play in a Studio, descend into Hell, explore the depths of the ocean floor, brave the frozen tundra of Antarctica, and even drum on the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/ce13bc6f76936f68987e9841518e8e8a.avif?t=1735077065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras_big/ce13bc6f76936f68987e9841518e8e8a.avif?t=1735077065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import custom songs into the game so you can expand the setlist with your own songs (guide included).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drum Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antarctica</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom of the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drumkits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-kit leftie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metallica (sound and setup)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rolling Stones (sound and setup)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on the drum kits and environments listed above however you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with our custom made songs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs the community have created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For details, see the custom song guide in the game's root folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIV Supported:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your best drum solo!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1dd15b17380519722d6ad63ea51fb505fa01662f.jpg","localized_name":"Yay. Achievements!","name":"Yay. Achievements!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/1dd15b17380519722d6ad63ea51fb505fa01662f.jpg"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Eager to learn!","name":"Eager to learn!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"First song!","name":"First song!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Rhythm Master!","name":"Rhythm Master!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Almost Perfect!","name":"Almost Perfect!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Perfect Timing!","name":"Perfect Timing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Combo King!","name":"Combo King!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Early Bird","name":"Early Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Speed Demon!","name":"Speed Demon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Steady Hands!","name":"Steady Hands!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1015480/"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1015480?t=1735077065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735077065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/ab578ddba13ec43f20db8fa04d72e56d3a77a7e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735077065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/ab578ddba13ec43f20db8fa04d72e56d3a77a7e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735077065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2151930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/e9349c54abb101e052157b8efb21d32e.avif?t=1735077065\" width=630 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DrumBeatsVR is a VR drumming music game that lets you experience the thrill of playing drums on a virtual stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place behind the kits of the most iconic players and play their parts, with your driving rhythm becoming the backbone of every song you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/7a9e558488fbb9988ad527f52eba23b6.avif?t=1735077065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras_big/7a9e558488fbb9988ad527f52eba23b6.avif?t=1735077065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a setlist of twenty-one songs and more on the way, you can play along to your favorite tunes and feel like you're part of the band. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in epic scenes that will transport you to otherworldly locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the comfort of your own home, you can play in a Studio, descend into Hell, explore the depths of the ocean floor, brave the frozen tundra of Antarctica, and even drum on the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras/ce13bc6f76936f68987e9841518e8e8a.avif?t=1735077065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015480/extras_big/ce13bc6f76936f68987e9841518e8e8a.avif?t=1735077065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import custom songs into the game so you can expand the setlist with your own songs (guide included).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drum Studio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antarctica</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom of the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drumkits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-kit leftie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metallica (sound and setup)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rolling Stones (sound and setup)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on the drum kits and environments listed above however you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with our custom made songs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play songs the community have created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For details, see the custom song guide in the game's root folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIV Supported:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your best drum solo!</p>","developers":["Marcel Eissens","VRROOM Ultimate VR